---
const cards = [
  {
    title: "What looks profitable only because you stop counting at the lead?",
    body: "Cost per demo is a platform number. Cost per customer only exists once the ad, the CRM and the closed deal are connected, and then the campaign that looked best usually isn't.",
    colStart: "md:col-start-1",
    rowStart: "md:row-start-1",
  },
  {
    title: "Does every button on your landing page fire?",
    body: "By developing research, company data, and pre-programmed rules, tracking effectively automates the answer — most of the time it doesn't fire.",
    colStart: "md:col-start-5",
    rowStart: "md:row-start-2",
  },
  {
    title: "How long does a paid lead sit before someone calls it?",
    body: "Traditional handoffs are labor-intensive and time-consuming, while the outcomes generated get worse the longer the lead sits cold.",
    colStart: "md:col-start-9",
    rowStart: "md:row-start-3",
  },
  {
    title: "Which of your pages actually rank, and which just exist?",
    body: "Content programs ship pages. Programmatic ones ship signals. Only one of the two shows up in the CRM and the P&L a quarter later.",
    colStart: "md:col-start-3",
    rowStart: "md:row-start-4",
  },
];
---

<section
  id="everything"
  class="border-b border-dashed border-[color:var(--color-rule)]"
>
  <div class="container-rail px-5 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-20">
    <h2 class="max-w-[720px]">
      Every agency owns one of these. The money is lost between them.
      That's the whole idea behind{" "}
      <span class="font-bold">everythink</span>.
    </h2>

    <div
      class="mt-10 md:mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 md:grid-rows-4 gap-y-5 md:gap-y-6 relative"
    >
      <div
        class="hidden md:grid pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 grid-cols-12"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        {
          Array.from({ length: 12 }).map(() => (
            <div class="border-l border-dashed border-[color:var(--color-rule)] first:border-l-0" />
          ))
        }
      </div>

      {
        cards.map((c) => (
          <div class={`md:col-span-4 ${c.colStart} ${c.rowStart} relative`}>
            <div class="p-5 border border-[color:var(--color-card)] rounded-xl bg-[color:var(--color-paper)]">
              <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">
                {c.title}
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--color-muted)]">
                {c.body}
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
